LineaScope — Data Acquisition and Processing Log
Project: AI-Based Geological Lineament Detection System
Author: Aguade Victoria
Institution: Delta State University, Abraka — Faculty of Computing
Study Area: Abraka and the Middle Ethiope River Corridor, Delta State, Nigeria
Bounding Box (WGS84): Lat 5.65–5.95° N; Lon 6.00–6.30° E
Working CRS: EPSG:32632 (WGS 84 / UTM zone 32N)
Grid Resolution: 20 m
Grid Size: 1672 columns × 1669 rows (≈ 2.79 million pixels per layer)
Log Version: 2.0
Last Updated: 7 October 2026

1. Environment and Tools
Component	Version / Detail
Operating System	Windows
Python	3.12
Virtual environment	lineascope-env
GIS software	QGIS (to be installed)
Version control	Git (local repository)
Primary libraries	numpy, scipy, pandas, rasterio, geopandas, shapely, pyproj, scikit-learn, scikit-image, opencv-python, matplotlib, joblib, osmnx, pytest, fastapi, uvicorn, pydantic, pyarrow
