3. OpenStreetMap Data
Downloaded using scripts/get_osm.py (via OSMnx from the Overpass API).

Layer	Features	Output file	CRS
Roads	2,423	data/osm/osm_roads.gpkg	EPSG:32632
Waterways	19	data/osm/osm_waterways.gpkg	EPSG:32632
Buildings	8,222	data/osm/osm_buildings.gpkg	EPSG:32632
Note: The low waterway count (19) is expected in this region. OSM coverage in the Niger Delta is incomplete. DEM-derived drainage will supplement this in the feature stack.

